div.p:
650. With results all 95 districts announced, following is parties standing in
                    order gains, losses, total: UNP 23, 12, 54;
                    Freedom Party 6, 6, 9; LSSP 1, 6, 9; Front 0, 2, 4; Tamil Cong 0, 1, 4; Federalist 1, 1, 2; Moors 2, 0, 2;
                    Labor 1, 1, 1; Peoples Republican 0, 1, 1; Independents including speaker 5, 2,
                    9. Of 7 former Indian Cong seats, UNP won 6, Labor 1.
